  "bio": "With a niche in watercolor style tattoos, Adrian Bascur is a remarkably talented tattoo artist based out of Viña del Mar, Chile. He has achieved a grand following of over 200,000 people on Instagram owing to his exceptional skill level and exquisite craftsmanship. His extraordinary work can be seen at the revered @bangbangnyc in Nueva York, making a strong testament to his prominent place in the tattoo industry.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Viña Del Mar, Valparaiso, Chile\n\nIllustration tattoo artist.\nFine line & sketch tattoos.\n📍@bangbangnyc NYC \nDM for bookings",
